cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or the MisconceptDialogue framework, please cite the paper below."
title: "MisconceptDialogue: Evaluation Criteria Shape Measured Success in LLM Math Tutoring"
abstract: >-
  An automated evaluation framework that decouples the detect-diagnose-remediate
  tutoring pipeline from the scoring lenses used to measure it, across five
  open-weight 7B-14B LLM tutors and 5,000+ simulated-student dialogues.
